# RobustToolbox engine pin for dm2ss14 (Phase 0+)

The generated SS14 solution builds against the REAL engine via ProjectReference
(`-p:EngineDir=` or the `SS14_ENGINE_DIR` env var). This file records which
engine commit the generated code + runtime template were verified against.

repo: https://github.com/space-wizards/RobustToolbox
commit: 9cefa1167c9ac45f7258094129daf46b6c3516d3
target-framework: net10.0
notes:
- A shallow clone suffices: `git clone --depth 1`
- Submodules are required for the build: `git submodule update --init --depth 1`
  (Lidgren.Network, NetSerializer, XamlX, Robust.LoaderApi, cefglue)
- Verified API surface (this commit):
  * EntitySystem (abstract partial) with [Dependency] EntityManager field
  * SubscribeLocalEvent<TComp, TEvent> with ComponentEventRefHandler
    signature (EntityUid uid, TComp comp, ref TEvent args), TEvent : notnull
  * ComponentInit : EntityEventArgs (sealed class, not a struct)
  * Component base class has NO public virtual Initialize() — lifecycle is
    event-driven (ComponentInit broadcast)
  * EntityManager.SpawnEntity(protoId, coordinates, overrides)
  * RegisterComponentAttribute; YAML component type = class name minus
    "Component" suffix; [DataField] for prototype serialization

Refresh procedure:
1. Update the engine checkout to a newer commit and bump `commit:` here.
2. Re-run `bash scripts/build-loop.sh`; fix any API drift in the runtime
   template / generated system template.
